n under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, more than any other pair. In 2025, September to October ran 55% of normal on the middle of the grids, and November to December ran 61%. Grid 13344 had its driest year in 2010 at 57% of normal. A preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 on grid 13345 sits at 46.3, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
